      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“No.” He puts the nails down. “Gritstone face in this country, you cannot walk under an overhang without wearing it. Every ledge on that cliff is white with them.” A hand toward the window. “Not that flight. Not one nest, not one streak, the whole length of it.”"
